# Website UX Design Rules Blender

Use this rule when editing:

- `tools/website-ux-auditor/design-rules/**`
- `tools/website-ux-auditor/checks/**`
- `docs/design/ux-audit/*.md`
- `tools/website-ux-auditor/lib/design-rule-runtime.js`

## Required workflow

1. Regenerate the rule registry:
   - `cd tools/website-ux-auditor && npm run blend-rules`
2. Ensure `design-rules/registry.generated.json` is updated in the same change.
3. Keep deterministic and AI lanes separate:
   - deterministic checks live under `design-rules/deterministic/**`
   - AI prompt fragments live under `design-rules/ai/prompts/**`
4. Do not couple `analyze-website-ux.mjs` and `score-website-ux.mjs`; both may share `lib/design-rule-runtime.js`.
5. Keep finding metadata populated for ranking:
   - `ruleId`, `scoreDimension`, `priorityWeight`, `sourceRule`, `scoreImpactWeight`
